            "review_title": "Review at Quan Ong Ha",
            "review_text": "Lam D\nHanoi, Vietnam329 contributions\n0\nGood breakfast in Lao Cai\nOct 2020 • Friends\nWe come here for breakfast when we stay in Lao Cai before we go to Sapa. This restaurant have 4 kind of noodles anh steam for breakfast so that it is easy for you to choose. Its delicious and traditional. The owner is wamly and the service is good, it take 35.000 VND about 1,5 usd for one bowl. For night they sell duck and chicken porridge. If you stay in Lao cai you should go there\nRead more\nWritten October 23, 2020",
            "rating": 5.0,
